WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/components/feedback/BrowserCompatBanner.tsx — a one-time, dismissible top-of-page warning.
    Binds ONLY useTranslation (no data hooks, no fetch). detectMissingFeatures() probes 5 web-platform
    features (BroadcastChannel, ResizeObserver, Intl.RelativeTimeFormat, CSS :has(), structuredClone).
    Sticky dismissal via localStorage "teslasync:compat-warning-dismissed:v1".
    `if (dismissed || missing.length === 0) return null` → else a warning AlertBanner with title +
    interpolated body ("TeslaSync needs {{features}} … {{recommendation}}") + a dismiss X whose aria-label
    is t('compat.banner.dismiss'). i18n keys: compat.banner.title / compat.banner.body / compat.banner.dismiss.
    States = { hidden, warning } ONLY — there is NO loading/error/stale/offline branch because the surface
    has no data source (the generic P4 state list does not apply; reproduced per "any state-specific branches
    that exist in the web source — read it and reproduce them all").

